title: 'pallet-session: release key deposit from the account that placed it'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Fixes #13582: release a validator's key deposit and consumer reference from the account that placed them, not from whichever account later purges or replaces the keys, since several accounts can convert to the same validator ID.
crates:
- name: pallet-session
  bump: major
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: bridge-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: collectives-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: coretime-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: people-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
